From f6b1dec4195ed8a41994dc82640fc8dd5db31128 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:26:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add incremental in-memory V2 collapsed UTXO tree

Maintain cached P02 roots with path-local insert, erase and proof generation. Preallocate split paths before moving existing nodes; reject duplicate keys and invalid or burn outputs. Differential native tests compare deterministic mixed updates, insertion orders and undo roots against the scalar UtxoSet oracle.
